SYNTHETIC ABAL PSEUDOCODE — not verified production syntax.
RULE CLASSIFY-TAX-BAND
INPUT ANNUAL_INCOME_CENTS, RESIDENT
IF ANNUAL_INCOME_CENTS < 0 THEN ERROR INVALID_INCOME
IF RESIDENT = FALSE THEN RETURN NON_RESIDENT
IF ANNUAL_INCOME_CENTS <= 1000000 THEN RETURN BASIC
IF ANNUAL_INCOME_CENTS <= 3000000 THEN RETURN STANDARD
RETURN HIGH
